<title>UK: Sigma Finance adds 100 mln SFR to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance adds 100 mln SFR to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *300 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    29.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> END OF SUB 09.JAN.97 MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	   AAA</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 125 MILLION SFR ON 30.OCT.96</p>
<p>		THEN INCREASED BY 75 MILLION ON 21.NOV.96, NOW</p>
<p>		FURTHER INCREASED BY 100 MILLION SFR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
